  "limitations": [
    "all measurements used unlocked clocks",
    "the optional microbenchmark is a synthetic kernel gate, not a model or serving-throughput result",
    "ASan and UBSan cover host code only; CUDA compute-sanitizer debugging features are disabled on this device, so device-memory validation relies on functional and bitwise CUDA tests",
    "the Nsight comparison uses separate baseline and candidate reports rather than a same-binary trial",
    "non-target kernels increased by 2.346432 ms between Nsight reports, so only the separately grouped GDN delta isolates this change",
    "the end-to-end benchmark has two process medians per implementation in mirrored order and is not a randomized trial",
    "the B-C-C-B logs do not embed executable hashes; variant identity relies on the recorded run order and separately hashed binaries",
    "the end-to-end result is batch-one generation for one short prompt and excludes engine-load time",
    "the production route is specific to the fixed Qwen3.6 48-value-head, 128-dimensional GDN contract and bounded token tiles through C16",
    "the raw benchmark logs, binaries, and Nsight reports are local evidence and are not checked into the repository",
    "this diagnostic does not establish continuous-batching, concurrent-request, or serving throughput"
  ],
